@title bit Generations - Coloris (Japan)
@file Bit Generations Coloris (J).gba
@game BVAJ
@chip SRAM
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
@save skip: nothing is written to SRAM through the menus, a Clear Mode board, its pause menu and quitting back to level select (the references leave blank 32 KB files, dingbat none); the first save needs a cleared board, and each emulator is dealt a different board from the same inputs (below), so no frozen route clears all three

# Health warning > A > logo > PRESS START > the mode menu (only CLEAR MODE
# on a blank cart) > CLEAR MODE > BASIC 01 > PRESS A > the board. Four A
# presses one up-right of the centre, then START: CONTINUE / RETRY / SLEEP /
# SELECT; SELECT > YES goes back to level select.
# Finding (board, f1676; docs/playtest-bugs.md §101, Coloris): each emulator
# is dealt another board. Not diagnostic (the references disagree too):
# the board is drawn from a Mersenne Twister seeded from timer 1 (prescaler
# 256) read in the frame that enters Clear Mode. dingbat and the second
# reference read it on the same line (79); mGBA 14.8k cycles earlier, on the
# same 27,170 instructions, most of it the 8-word ldmia from ROM in the
# BIOS's CpuFastSet (36 cycles against mGBA's 32); and the second
# reference's timer runs 620 ticks ahead from its boot entry (§85).
# Board seed: 0x0800D3EC stores ((t << 3) | ((t >> 3) & 7)) & 0x3FF, t =
# TM1CNT_L, at 0x0200B1F0 when Clear Mode is entered; 0x08010294 seeds the
# board's MT19937 (0x0200CCC0) with it when the level starts. dingbat 0x028
# (t & 0x7F = 5), mgba 0x261 (76), the second reference 0x38E (113).

[new]
wait 300
checkpoint warning window=30
press A
wait 500
checkpoint logo window=30
press START
wait 120
checkpoint press_start window=30
press START
wait 120
press A
wait 120
checkpoint clear_mode window=30
press A
wait 120
press A
wait 120
checkpoint board window=30
press RIGHT after=20
press UP after=20
tap A times=4 every=20 hold=4
press START after=60
checkpoint pause window=0 compare=text
press DOWN after=15
press DOWN after=15
press DOWN after=15
press A after=120
checkpoint quit_prompt window=0 compare=text
press DOWN after=15
press A after=150
checkpoint back_to_select window=30
